<title>USA: World market rice prices -- USDA.</title>
<headline>World market rice prices -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department reported the prevailing world market prices of milled rice, loan rate basis, effective from today as follows:</p>
<p>-- Long grain whole kernels, 13.59 cts per lb, versus 13.59 cts a week earlier.</p>
<p>-- Medium grain whole kernels, 10.29 cts, versus 10.29.</p>
<p>-- Short grain whole kernels,  10.28 cts, versus 10.28.</p>
<p>-- Broken kernels, 6.80 cts, versus 6.80 cts.</p>
</text>
